<title>USA: Most IMM currency futures weaken in light trade.</title>
<headline>Most IMM currency futures weaken in light trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 22 - IMM currency futures were mostly lower in light afternoon trade. June yen broke to $0.008638, while June marks trimmed gains to $0.5903. Sterling widened losses, with June falling through 100-day moving avg of $1.6312. Pesos turned lower after June set a contract high of $0.126100.</p>
<p>((Derivatives desk 312-408-8750))</p>
